OL,3,ATreatment involving patient's family
OL,4,Acuts mental health hospital admissions,
OL,5,Astudy finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FInvolving a patient's family and
OL,8,Ffriends as part of a new approach to
OL,9,Fmental health treatment makes it three
OL,10,Ftimes less likely they will be admitted
OL,11,Fto psychiatric hospital, research has
OL,12,Ffound.
OL,14,FPatients rated their recovery and
OL,15,Fquality of life more highly than those
OL,16,Fwho were treated in the traditional
OL,17,Fway, the study published in The Lancet
OL,18,FPsychiatry also found.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
