OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATreatment involving patient's family
OL,4,Acuts mental health hospital admissions,
OL,5,Astudy finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is the first major study of Open
OL,8,FDialogue, a way of providing treatment
OL,9,Fand organising mental health services
OL,10,Fthat involves focusing on the patient's
OL,11,Fpriorities, seeing the same clinicians,
OL,12,Fand involving people close to them.
OL,14,FBut, the trial, in five NHS trust
OL,15,Fareas, found it did not stop patients
OL,16,Fsuffering relapses, and some critics
OL,17,Fsay there needs to be further research
OL,18,Finto its effectiveness.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
